		(descr "DRAFT contact landing only for VLV041235L FPC. Contact dimensions 0.8x1.8 mm, 1.0 mm gap, 1.8 mm pitch from Vybronics A/2 p10. Proposed PCB lands 1.0x2.2 mm; validate on a sample. No actuator body courtyard; place/retain body separately. Pad numbering is project-assigned, not manufacturer polarity. No paste apertures; local solder attachment after PCB assembly.")
